                                "sense_id": "0ab7f85c-00a7-3c5f-be61-ff1e62d95fc1",
                                "text": "2024, Michael Ojugo, Clement Ojugo, Destined for Greatness\nBecause if they never think about you, that means you have never made yourself valuable or unvaluable. You have become a jack of too many trades. So you master nothing."
                            }
                        ]
