                                "sense_id": "1b98ad53-39c8-3828-9235-6d3163c7e3ae",
                                "text": "I kon him thanks that he hath had the hap to chuse, and knowledge to cull-out so worthy a worke, and a booke so fit to the purpose, therewith to make so unvaluable a present unto his Countrie."
